      "title": "Renewable does not mean an unchanged price",
      "text": "For individual renewable term, the actual renewal premiums must be shown. The Maryland rule separately allows the specified wholesale or group table change on an anniversary with 30 days’ notice. Do not apply that group exception to every individual contract.",
